{
  "name": "ReviewPilot - Analyze Pull Request",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ReviewPilot - Analyze Pull Request (Fase 6 — GitHub MCP Read-Only)\n- **Webhook Trigger (`Receive Review Dispatch`):** autenticado via credencial Header Auth (`ReviewPilot Internal Service Auth`).\n- **Validação Determinística (`Validate Dispatch Payload`):** valida campos obrigatórios de `contracts/review-request.schema.json`.\n- **Modelo LLM (`Google Gemini Chat Model`):** configurado com `models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite` (`temperature: 0.1`, `maxOutputTokens: 4096`) e credencial `ReviewPilot Google Gemini API`.\n- **Ferramentas GitHub MCP Read-Only (`Call n8n Workflow Tool`):** `github_pr_read_tool`, `github_get_file_contents_tool` e `github_list_commits_tool` encapsulam chamadas `HTTP Streamable` a `https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/` sem expor nenhuma ferramenta de escrita.\n- **AI Agent Slot (`Stage Placeholder - Review Agent (Phase 7)`):** na Fase 7 será substituído pelo nó `AI Agent (Tools Agent)` conectado ao `Google Gemini Chat Model` e às ferramentas MCP.\n- **Retorno ao Backend (`Submit Review Result` / `Report Execution Failure`):** envia resultado ou falha controlada aos endpoints `/api/internal/v1/reviews/{id}/results` e `/failure`.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 720
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000001",
      "name": "Architecture Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "reviewpilot-dispatch",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000002",
      "name": "Receive Review Dispatch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        360
      ],
      "webhookId": "reviewpilot-dispatch",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID_INTERNAL_SERVICE_AUTH",
          "name": "ReviewPilot Internal Service Auth"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Receives internal dispatch from Spring Boot backend authenticated with X-Internal-Service-Token."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-review-execution-id",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.reviewExecutionId }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-repo-full-name",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.repositoryFullName }}",
              "rightValue": "^[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+/[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+$",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-pr-number",
              "leftValue": "={{ Number($json.body.pullRequestNumber) }}",
              "rightValue": 1,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-head-sha",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.expectedHeadSha }}",
              "rightValue": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{40}$",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-base-branch",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.baseBranch }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000003",
      "name": "Validate Dispatch Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        360
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Validates required fields from contracts/review-request.schema.json."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={\n  \"status\": \"ACCEPTED\",\n  \"reviewExecutionId\": \"{{ $json.body.reviewExecutionId }}\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 202
        }
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000004",
      "name": "Acknowledge Dispatch Accepted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        700,
        260
      ],
